# Lodestone Needle // Guidestone Compass. With flash the first Needle is cast in Bot2's end step: "tap up to one target
# artifact or creature and put two stun counters on it" taps Bot2's Ornithopter and stuns it twice, so its next untap step
# only takes a stun counter off (CR 122.1d). The second Needle chooses no target and does nothing. The first crafts with
# the second (Craft with artifact {2}{U}) into Guidestone Compass: "{1}, {T}: Target creature you control explores.
# Activate only as a sorcery" is not offered in Bot2's upkeep (refused); on turn five Llanowar Elves explores a nonland
# card (a +1/+1 counter, the card put into the graveyard), on turn seven a land (into the hand).

